meta {
  name: 11. Publish DataSet
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datasets/:id/publish
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: {{sagaDataSetId}}
}

docs {
  ## Publish DataSet (DRAFT → READY)

  **Precondition:** `sagaDataSetId` is set (from step 8); dataset has at least one pipeline with datasources.

  Transitions the dataset from DRAFT to READY. Generates distributions from pipeline APIs.
  No infrastructure provisioning happens yet — that occurs on release (step 12).

  **Expected Response**
  - Status: `200 OK`
  - Body reflects dataset with status `READY`

  **System Impact**

  | System | Expected Change |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | DataSet status updated to `READY` in `portal_backend` DB; distributions generated from pipeline APIs |
}
